  "source": "gin",
  "readme": "## EEGManyLabs - Replication Raw Dataset - Eimer1996\nRaw data for the #EEGManyLabs replication of Experiment 2 of Eimer's seminal N2pc study (1996).\n**BE AWARE - EEG data from multiple different sites.**\nRecordings have different sampling rates, channel layouts, recording references, and have not been rereferenced.\n### Curation pipeline\nThe EEG data were curated and formatted according to BIDS standard. Trigger codes and channel names were harmonized, acq_date was changed for deidentification, and the otherwise unchanged raw recordings were exported to consistent BIDS compliant format (BrainVision).\n### See also:\n- **Replication paper:**\n  Constant et al., 2025; https://osf.io/preprints/psyarxiv/3472y_v2 (RR stage 2 preprint)\n- **OSF page of the replication:**\n  https://osf.io/4ux8r/\n- **Replicated publication:**\n  Eimer, 1996; https://doi.org/10.1016/0013-4694(96)95711-9\n- **EEGManyLabs project:**\n  Pavlov et al., 2021; https://doi.org/gjx8qt",
